  "releaseNotes": "- Simplified integration for popular Nepali payment providers\n        • eSewa\n        • Khalti\n        • Fonepay (Dynamic QR support)\n      - Easy-to-use APIs for faster payment gateway implementation\n      - 2.0.1: Fix Fonepay HMAC-SHA512 signing — dataValidation was base64-encoded,\n        but Fonepay's API requires lowercase hex, so every signed request (QR\n        generation, status check, tax refund) was being rejected with\n        \"Data Validation Failed\". eSewa's HMAC-SHA256 signing is unaffected.",
